guide.welcome=Hello adventurer!\n\nThis is your guidebook.\n\nUse it to learn about the addon and all its features. Some topics might be locked for now but will unlock later on.\n\n

guide.tameable=Tameable
guide.boss=Boss
guide.general_dragon1=Tameable dragons are magical creatures that can fly similar to ghasts and use a power jump to start flying.\n\n
guide.general_dragon2=Every dragon has its own unique taming and healing item. Rideable dragons can be equipped with both a saddle and a chest for storage. When interacting with it and holding a glass bottle it will fill it with dragon breath.
guide.general_dragon3=Furthermore when riding the dragon and interacting with it the dragon will fire a projectile.\n\n
guide.general_dragon4=\n\nThe crystal drakes can be summoned through a special altar and the use of a unique totem (more about that in the special material section). Crystal drakes cannot fly but possess a wide range of powerful attacks and are hostile to players. Defeat them so see their loot.
